# Generated test material and reports.
# These patterns are deliberately anchored with a leading slash so they match
# ONLY these top-level folders. An unanchored "reports/" would also match any
# folder named "reports" anywhere in the tree — including the engine's own
# source package apps/engine/diffnexa_engine/reports/, which is exactly how that
# package was silently left out of the first commit.
/golden/.generated/
/reports/

